OL,3,GNEWSAReckless e-bike riders 'dangerous'
OL,4,Afor cyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FCyclists say recklessly ridden and
OL,7,Fillegally souped up e-bikes have become
OL,8,Fa danger to them on the capital's bike
OL,9,Flanes and roads.
OL,11,FMorwenna Hughes was riding on a
OL,12,Fconventional bicycle on a busy, two-way
OL,13,Fcycle lane in Hammersmith when an
OL,14,Fe-bike rider cut her up and knocked her
OL,15,Foff in a hit and run.
OL,17,FHer face was smashed and she may not
OL,18,Fregain full mobility in her left arm
OL,19,Fafter it was shattered in the crash.
